error[E0828]: `x` is bound by another alternative of this or-pattern, but not by this one
 --> mem:///main.lu:4:22
  |
4 |     match v { A(x) | B(_) => x }
  |                 - `x` is bound here
  |                      ^^^^ this alternative binds no `x`
  |
  = note: every alternative of an or-pattern binds the same names, because the arm's body sees `x`
    whichever alternative matched ([gram.pat.or]). Bind `x` in this alternative too, or
    write the alternatives as separate arms.
